msgid "CV融合算子开发"
msgstr "CV Fusion Operator Development"

msgid "CV融合算子指同一个算子中同时使用Cube Core和Vector Core：Cube Core通常负责 `tl.dot`、矩阵乘或卷积式主计算，Vector Core负责bias、activation、softmax、归约、mask、layout重排或跨块同步。CV融合的目标是减少kernel边界和GM往返，但需要同时控制Cube tile、Vector tile、UB/L1占用和同步关系。"
msgstr "CV fusion operators use both the Cube Core and the Vector Core in the same operator: The Cube Core typically handles `tl.dot`, matrix multiplication, or convolution-style main computation. The Vector Core handles bias, activation, softmax, reduction, mask, layout rearrangement, or cross-block synchronization. The goal of CV fusion is to reduce kernel boundaries and GM round trips. However, you must simultaneously control the Cube tile, Vector tile, UB/L1 occupancy, and synchronization relationships."

msgid "CV融合简单算子开发"
msgstr "CV Fusion Simple Operator Development"

msgid "简单CV融合建议先从本仓 [矩阵乘法样例](../examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md) 抽出稳定的 `tl.dot` 主计算，再在写回前加入Vector后处理；更复杂的切片更新可参考 [融合注意力样例](../examples/04_fused_attention_example.md)。最小路径如下："
msgstr "For simple CV fusion, first extract the stable `tl.dot` main computation from the [matrix multiplication sample](../examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md) in this repository. Then, add Vector post-processing before the write-back. For more complex slice updates, refer to the [fused attention sample](../examples/04_fused_attention_example.md). The minimum path is as follows:"

msgid "先实现稳定的Cube主计算，例如 `acc = tl.dot(a, b, acc)`。"
msgstr "First, implement the stable main Cube computation, for example, `acc = tl.dot(a, b, acc)`."

msgid "在accumulator写回前融合轻量Vector后处理，例如bias、scale、activation或dtype cast。"
msgstr "Fuse lightweight Vector post-processing, for example, bias, scale, activation, or dtype cast, before writing back the accumulator."

msgid "对较大的accumulator，可使用 `range` 配合 `extension.extract_slice`/`extension.insert_slice` 做普通子块切分，避免Vector后处理阶段UB overflow。"
msgstr "For large accumulators, you can use `range` with `extension.extract_slice`/`extension.insert_slice` for regular sub-block tiling to avoid UB overflow in the Vector post-processing stage."

msgid "`extension.parallel(..., bind_sub_block=True)` 属于更强的显式多Vector子块绑定路径，目标硬件和编译配置存在差异时可能不可用，不建议作为简单示例的默认写法。"
msgstr "`extension.parallel(..., bind_sub_block=True)` belongs to a stronger explicit multi-Vector sub-block binding path. It may be unavailable if the target hardware and compilation configurations vary. Do not use it as the default approach for simple samples."

msgid "示例结构："
msgstr "Sample structure:"

msgid ""
"# 在matmul kernel内部，K循环完成后得到fp32 accumulator。\n"
"acc = tl.dot(a, b, acc)  # 通常位于K维循环内，这里仅展示结构。\n"
"\n"
"# 在写回前融合轻量Vector后处理。\n"
"acc = tl.where(acc >= 0, acc, 0.01 * acc)\n"
"c = acc.to(tl.float16)\n"
"\n"
"offs_m = pid_m * BLOCK_M + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_M)\n"
"offs_n = pid_n * BLOCK_N + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_N)\n"
"c_ptrs = c_ptr + offs_m[:, None] * stride_cm + offs_n[None, :] * stride_cn\n"
"c_mask = (offs_m[:, None] < M) & (offs_n[None, :] < N)\n"
"tl.store(c_ptrs, c, mask=c_mask)\n"
msgstr ""
"# Inside the matmul kernel, after the K loop completes, an fp32 accumulator is obtained.\n"
"acc = tl.dot(a, b, acc)  # Typically located inside the K-dimension loop; here only the structure is shown.\n"
"\n"
"# Fuse lightweight Vector post-processing before writeback.\n"
"acc = tl.where(acc >= 0, acc, 0.01 * acc)\n"
"c = acc.to(tl.float16)\n"
"\n"
"offs_m = pid_m * BLOCK_M + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_M)\n"
"offs_n = pid_n * BLOCK_N + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_N)\n"
"c_ptrs = c_ptr + offs_m[:, None] * stride_cm + offs_n[None, :] * stride_cn\n"
"c_mask = (offs_m[:, None] < M) & (offs_n[None, :] < N)\n"
"tl.store(c_ptrs, c, mask=c_mask)\n"

msgid "简单CV融合开发时要保持边界清晰：Cube负责产生较大的二维accumulator，Vector负责同一tile内的逐元素或小规模归约。若Vector部分需要跨多个Cube tile共享状态，就需要引入同步、workspace或拆分kernel。"
msgstr "When developing simple CV fusion, keep boundaries clear: Cube generates large 2D accumulators, and Vector handles element-wise operations or small-scale reductions within the same tile. If the Vector part needs to share state across multiple Cube tiles, you must introduce synchronization, a workspace, or split the kernel."

msgid "CV融合复杂算子开发"
msgstr "CV Fusion Complex Operator Development"

msgid "复杂CV融合可参考 [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops) 中的best practice："
msgstr "For complex CV fusion, refer to the best practices in [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops):"

msgid "[`tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py)：Decode attention中QK/PV使用Cube，softmax、mask、指数、归一化和离散KV访存重排使用Vector。"
msgstr "[`tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py): In Decode attention, QK/PV use Cube, and softmax, mask, exponentiation, normalization, and discrete KV memory access rearrangement use Vector."

msgid "[`tutorial/best_practice/003-fused-cat-slice-conv1d.zh.md`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/003-fused-cat-slice-conv1d.zh.md)：展示融合cat、slice、conv1d update时如何用 `extension.insert_slice`、转置和分核优化减少离散访存与padding开销。"
msgstr "[`tutorial/best_practice/003-fused-cat-slice-conv1d.zh.md`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/003-fused-cat-slice-conv1d.zh.md): Demonstrates how to use `extension.insert_slice`, transposition, and core partitioning optimization to reduce discrete memory access and padding overhead when fusing cat, slice, and conv1d update."

msgid "复杂CV融合建议按数据流分层组织："
msgstr "For complex CV fusion, organize by data flow in layers:"

msgid "**主计算层**：识别哪些步骤必须走Cube，例如QK、PV、GEMM、batched matmul。"
msgstr "**Main compute layer**: Identify which steps must use the Cube core, for example, QK, PV, GEMM, and batched matmul."

msgid "**Vector后处理层**：识别softmax、activation、mask、scale、normalization、cat/slice、layout transform等是否能在同一tile内完成。"
msgstr "**Vector post-processing layer**: Identifies whether operations such as softmax, activation, mask, scale, normalization, cat/slice, and layout transform can be completed within the same tile."

msgid "**访存重排层**：对离散KV cache、MoE token重排、短尾轴（最后一个维度）tensor，优先在UB中用 `extension.insert_slice`、`extension.extract_slice`、转置或借轴转置形成硬件友好的连续访问。"
msgstr "**Memory access rearrangement layer**: For discrete KV cache, MoE token rearrangement, and short-tail axis (last dimension) tensors, prioritize using `extension.insert_slice`, `extension.extract_slice`, transposition, or borrowed-axis transposition in the UB to achieve hardware-friendly contiguous memory access."

msgid "**流水和同步层**：通过 `multibuffer`、`set_workspace_multibuffer`、`tile_mix_vector_loop`、`tile_mix_cube_loop` 等编译选项探索Cube与Vector的重叠执行。"
msgstr "**Pipeline and synchronization layer**: Explore overlapping execution of Cube and Vector using compilation options such as `multibuffer`, `set_workspace_multibuffer`, `tile_mix_vector_loop`, and `tile_mix_cube_loop`."

msgid "**分核层**：CV融合算子通常按Cube Core数量发射grid；运行时会以约1:2的比例协同Vector Core。不要简单沿用GPU上的大grid。"
msgstr "**Core-level**: CV fusion operators typically launch grids based on the number of Cube Cores; at runtime, Vector Cores are coordinated at an approximately 1:2 ratio. Do not simply reuse the large grid approach from GPUs."

msgid "对于attention类CV融合，推荐先让非causal、短序列、小head_dim的case跑通，再逐步加入："
msgstr "For attention-type CV fusion, first get non-causal, short-sequence, and small head_dim cases running, and then gradually add:"

msgid "causal mask分阶段处理。"
msgstr "The causal mask is processed in stages."

msgid "长序列K/V block循环。"
msgstr "Long sequence K/V block loop."

msgid "`m_i`/`l_i` 的数值稳定softmax更新。"
msgstr "Numerically stable softmax update for `m_i`/`l_i`."

msgid "HEAD_DIM较大时的accumulator workspace和子块切分。"
msgstr "Accumulator workspace and sub-block tiling when HEAD_DIM is large."

msgid "KV cache离散索引下的load重排。"
msgstr "Load reordering under discrete KV cache indices."

msgid "复杂CV融合调优时，优先观察profiling中Cube、Vector、MTE2的时间占比。如果Cube等待Vector，考虑减少Vector后处理粒度或打开CV balance相关选项；如果Vector等待搬运，优先检查离散访存、tail-axis padding和multibuffer配置。"
msgstr "When tuning complex CV fusion, first observe the time proportions of Cube, Vector, and MTE2 in the profiling. If Cube waits for Vector, consider reducing the Vector post-processing granularity or enabling CV balance-related options. If Vector waits for data movement, first check the discrete memory access, tail-axis padding, and multibuffer configurations."
